{
  "description": "tikajs-ibvq. Adapted from xberg (MIT) td/EPUB_EDGE_CASES.md + epub_hardening_tests.rs (#1488). Oracle Tika 4.2.0 /rmeta: a chapter with a mismatched closing tag is a TIKA-237 container exception (tk:exception:container-exception); its text up to the error and every other chapter are still written.",
  "tags": [
    "xberg",
    "epub",
    "edge"
  ],
  "input": {
    "base64": "",
    "filename": "a.epub"
  },
  "assertions": [
    {
      "type": "contains",
      "field": "text",
      "value": "GOOD-CHAPTER"
    },
    {
      "type": "contains",
      "field": "text",
      "value": "BROKEN-CHAPTER"
    },
    {
      "type": "contains",
      "field": "text",
      "value": "AFTER-CHAPTER"
    }
  ]
}
